    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 18,
    "summary": "Jesus is betrayed and arrested—He is examined and maltreated first before Annas, then before Caiaphas—Peter denies knowing Jesus—Jesus is arraigned before Pilate.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "When Jesus had spoken these words, he went forth with his disciples over the brook Cedron, where was a garden, into the which he entered, and his disciples.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "John 18:1",
        "book": "John",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "And Judas also, which betrayed him, knew the place: for Jesus ofttimes resorted thither with his disciples.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "John 18:2",
        "book": "John",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Judas then, having received a band of men and officers from the chief priests and Pharisees, cometh thither with lanterns and torches and weapons.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 35,
            "end": 41
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "John 18:3",
        "book": "John",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "Jesus therefore, knowing all things that should come upon him, went forth, and said unto them, Whom seek ye?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "John 18:4",
        "book": "John",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "They answered him, Jesus of Nazareth. Jesus saith unto them, I am he. And Judas also, which betrayed him, stood with them.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 66,
            "end": 69
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "John 18:5",
        "book": "John",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "As soon then as he had said unto them, I am he, they went backward, and fell to the ground.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 44,
            "end": 47
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "John 18:6",
        "book": "John",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Then asked he them again, Whom seek ye? And they said, Jesus of Nazareth.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "John 18:7",
        "book": "John",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "Jesus answered, I have told you that I am he: if therefore ye seek me, let these go their way:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 42,
            "end": 45
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "John 18:8",
        "book": "John",
        "chapter": 18,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
